      "content": "but i literally just feel so tired... like i haven't slept well in weeks. i dont want to deal with an er waiting room if i'm just run down. i'm pretty sure it's just stress and lack of sleep. isn't it possible it's just exhaustion causing the weird feeling in my arm? i'd rather just rest for a few hours and see if it goes away before i make a big deal out of it.",
